    "alProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"code\",\"message\"],\"properties\":{\"code\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"message\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"details\":{}}}}},{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"state\",\"command_id\",\"reconciliation_contract\",\"idempotency_key\",\"reason\"],\"properties\":{\"state\":{\"const\":\"unknown\"},\"command_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"reconciliation_contract\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"id\",\"version\",\"cid\"],\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"version\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"cid\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$\"}}},\"idempotency_key\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1},\"reason\":{\"enum\":[\"transport_timeout\",\"connection_lost\",\"provider_outcome_unknown\"]}}}]}",
  ].join(""))
